  "after": [],
  "status": "wip",
  "needs_ocr": false,
  "notes": [
    "The daily attendance book (first tab) is claimed at login by the attendance popups. The other tabs are campaign attendance books; their number changes with the season.",
    "Runs early: the rewards can include AP.",
    "Tabs are taken by position (second to sixth slot). A tab is opened only while it shows the red reward dot, and 'claim' is pressed only while it is yellow.",
    "After a claim the task waits until the book is uncovered again (the white top bar is bright), and only then looks at the next tab: under a window that darkens the screen the red dots do not match, and the remaining tabs were skipped without an error. A window that stays (a notice the popups do not know, such as AP at its limit) is closed with back, which is pressed only while the book is covered.",
    "verify: the notice shown when AP is at 999 (not seen yet; closing it with back is assumed)."
  ],
  "steps": [
    { "action": "goto", "page": "attendance" },
    { "action": "wait_stable", "timeout_ms": 4000 },
    {
